cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "factor-rag: Structure-Aware Chunking for Retrieval over Visually Rich Documents"
abstract: >-
  A Markdown chunker for retrieval-augmented generation over documents converted
  from PDF by a layout parser. It keeps pipe tables, fenced blocks and figure
  captions intact, repeats table headers across split parts, and attaches heading
  breadcrumbs to every chunk. Ships a metric suite and a reproducible benchmark
  for scoring any chunking strategy on structural fidelity.
type: software
